The proofs of XTopJointRecvIpcLink's `jRecvIpcU_of` sub-leaves end in `RJ` (`JAt`, ghosts existential) but
build their exit at the entry's `H` and `Cs` (at `Z.mv G V`). This file is those proofs verbatim, named `…St`,
with the post `RelTopM ∧ JStab Z H Cs` (StPostFault) and the final packaging adjusted:

* `JAtZ.recvIpcBlockJGSt` (XTopJointRecvIpcBlock)
* `JAtZ.recvIpcBlockJSt` (XTopJointRecvIpcBlock)
* `JAtZ.recvIpcRetJSt` (XTopJointRecvIpcRet)
* `JAtZ.recvIpcBlockNJGSt` (XTopJointRecvIpcBound)
* `JAtZ.recvIpcBlockNJSt` (XTopJointRecvIpcBound)
* `JAtZ.recvIpcPollJRSt` (XTopJointRecvIpc)
* `JAtZ.recvIpcPollJSt` (XTopJointRecvIpc)
* `JAtZ.recvIpcPollNJSt` (XTopJointRecvIpc)
* `JAtZ.recvIpcActJSt` (XTopJointRecvIpcAct)

